# Whitelist mode: ignore EVERYTHING except notebooks, scripts, and docs.
# This lets you copy the full raw training folder (with all its data) into
# the repo — git will only ever pick up the small teaching files.

# 1) ignore everything...
*

# 2) ...but keep descending into folders so git can find the files below
!*/

# 3) ...and keep only these file types
!*.ipynb
!*.py
!*.md
!*.sh
!.gitignore

# Even for kept types, never these:
.ipynb_checkpoints/
__pycache__/
kaggle.json
